    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 5eb27d380fa8a25b8aff91ef54f1ce3b31260c2e -->\nDelta re-check (read-only, not rebuilt): the new head 5eb27d38 is the merge of main into the reviewed head 0ea437f9. It is the only commit added since our review.\n\n**Ready for the maintainer to merge.** A maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n\nWhat holds:\n- Single new commit, a merge commit (parents 0ea437f9 = reviewed head, c8a1bab1 = main). No non-merge commits.\n- Hand-resolved file: `crates/app/src/commands/mod.rs`, the only combined hunk. Keep-both holds: `pub use tool_cutter::{ReshapeTool, SetToolCutter};` (this PR) and `pub use tool_import::{ImportMode, ImportReport, ImportTools};` (main). Nothing from either side dropped.\n- The other files that differ from both parents (`lib.rs`, `ui/.../mod.rs`, `pages.rs`, `tests.rs`, `structural.rs`, `state.rs`) have no combined hunks, so they took one side cleanly.\n- `git diff origin/main...5eb27d38` lists only this PR's own files (19 files, `cutter_fit`, `tool_cutter*`, `egui_app` tool-cutter page and tests, one decision file). No snapshot PNG, no `.github/`, no unrelated crate.\n- GitHub reports MERGEABLE.\n\nNot re-run here: the targeted gate on the merge was green per the maintainer session (the app `--lib` target was skipped at that time because main did not compile, issue #1146, fixed since in aca634f6).\n",
